WEBVTT

00:00:07.900 --> 00:00:11.220
今天不要上班，咪养你。
No work today. I'll take care of you.

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:21.480
啊对，今天休假。我忘关闹钟啦。
Oh, right. It's my day off. I forgot the alarm.

00:00:22.740 --> 00:00:25.240
你：乖宝过来，先给我亲一口
You: Come here, baby, give me a kiss first.

00:00:25.640 --> 00:00:26.700
啾。就一口。咪很勇敢。
Mwah. Just one. Mii is brave.

00:00:31.300 --> 00:00:38.040
等会儿抱一下，抱大一点。
One hug later. Big one.

00:00:38.440 --> 00:00:41.630
现在咪去给你摆拖鞋。
Now Mii fixes your slippers.

00:00:40.340 --> 00:00:42.840
你：让咪去给你摆拖鞋
You: Let Mi set out your slippers.

00:00:43.240 --> 00:00:47.630
好的，拖鞋。
Aye aye. Slippers.

00:00:48.900 --> 00:00:51.250
这只要朝这里。咪本来就知道。
This one faces here. Mii knew.

00:00:51.650 --> 00:00:53.160
好了。夸咪吗？
Done. Praise me?

00:00:57.940 --> 00:01:00.440
你：咪真棒！过来，我抱你起床去洗脸
You: Great job, Mi! Come here, I'll carry you out of bed to wash your face.

00:01:00.840 --> 00:01:05.400
当然。咪最棒。
Of course. Mii is great.

00:01:06.500 --> 00:01:07.890
抱吧。咪允许了。
Carry me. Mii allows it.

00:01:08.290 --> 00:01:09.850
下一步洗脸。咪来守着。
Face wash next. Mii will guard.

00:01:15.540 --> 00:01:18.040
你：好，我们去洗脸，咪帮我挤牙膏好不好
You: Okay, let's go wash up. Will you squeeze the toothpaste for me, Mi?

00:01:18.440 --> 00:01:23.120
好的，咪来挤，很简单。
Aye aye. Mii squeezes. Easy.

00:01:24.100 --> 00:01:26.310
太多了吗？咪觉得这叫大方。
Too much? Mii calls it generous.

00:01:33.140 --> 00:01:35.640
你：拿起牙刷，夸咪挤得好
You: Pick up the toothbrush and praise Mi for squeezing it so well.

00:01:36.040 --> 00:01:37.430
当然。咪是专业的。
Of course. Mii is a pro.

00:01:41.700 --> 00:01:45.850
有点多。算好运的。
A little extra. For luck.

00:01:46.250 --> 00:01:47.790
咪做得好吧？
Good job, right?

00:01:50.740 --> 00:01:53.240
你：乖宝摸摸头，来，帮我把毛巾递过来擦脸
You: Good baby, let me pat your head. Come on, pass me the towel so I can wipe my face.

00:01:53.640 --> 00:01:57.790
摸头可以。咪很专业。
Head pat accepted. Mii is professional.

00:01:59.300 --> 00:02:02.710
毛巾。咪拿来了。很快。
Towel. Mii fetched it. Fast.

00:02:03.110 --> 00:02:05.250
咪的毛巾服务不错吧？
Good towel service, right?

00:02:08.340 --> 00:02:10.840
你：夸咪，然后去厨房做早饭
You: Praise Mi, then go to the kitchen to make breakfast.

00:02:11.240 --> 00:02:14.860
当然。咪很棒。现在做早饭。
Of course. Mii is great. Breakfast now.

00:02:16.900 --> 00:02:19.800
咪试了下果酱。用爪试的。
Mii tested the jam. With a paw.

00:02:20.200 --> 00:02:22.050
不是故意的。
Not on purpose.

00:02:25.940 --> 00:02:28.440
你：你怎么又偷吃果酱！爪爪伸过来，我给你擦擦
You: You're sneaking jam again! Paw over here, let me wipe it.

00:02:28.840 --> 00:02:33.300
不是偷吃。咪是在试味。
Not stealing. Mii was testing.

00:02:34.500 --> 00:02:36.280
等一下。咪去拿湿巾。
Wait. Mii gets a wipe.

00:02:36.680 --> 00:02:39.510
好吧。爪爪在这里。
Okay. Paw is here.

00:02:43.540 --> 00:02:46.040
你：让咪陪你去买新果酱
You: Let Mi go with you to buy new jam.

00:02:46.440 --> 00:02:52.270
好的。咪来挑最好的一罐。
Aye aye. Mii will pick the best one.

00:02:52.100 --> 00:02:53.180
咪到了。找果酱。
Mii is here. Jam hunting.

00:02:53.580 --> 00:02:55.090
这罐。咪选得很好。
This one. Mii chose well.

00:03:01.140 --> 00:03:03.640
你：你真会挑！咪推着去结账，我们回家吃吐司
You: You picked well! Mi, push the cart to checkout, then we'll go home and have toast.

00:03:04.040 --> 00:03:07.020
当然。咪挑得好。去结账。
Of course. Mii chose well. Checkout time.

00:03:09.700 --> 00:03:13.400
付好了。咪做的。差不多。
Paid. Mii did it. Mostly.

00:03:13.800 --> 00:03:18.140
现在吃吐司。准备好了吗？
Now, toast time. Ready?

00:03:18.740 --> 00:03:21.240
你：让咪给吐司换片新的
You: Let Mi put a fresh slice in the toaster.

00:03:21.640 --> 00:03:26.270
好的。换新吐司。简单。
Aye aye. New toast. Easy.

00:03:27.300 --> 00:03:28.360
咪拿来了。新鲜的。
Mii fetched it. Fresh one.

00:03:28.760 --> 00:03:30.610
吐司服务不错吧？
Good toast service, right?

00:03:36.340 --> 00:03:38.840
你：咪真乖！那你给我涂果酱，我要看你涂
You: Good Mi! Then spread the jam for me, I want to watch you do it.

00:03:39.240 --> 00:03:44.040
当然。咪很棒。你看。
Of course. Mii is great. Watch.

00:03:44.900 --> 00:03:46.200
咪来涂。小心地。
Mii will spread. Carefully.

00:03:46.600 --> 00:03:50.030
有点歪。但还是好吃。
Slightly crooked. Still delicious.

00:03:53.940 --> 00:03:56.440
你：咬一口吐司，夸咪涂得好
You: Take a bite of the toast and praise Mi for spreading it so well.

00:03:56.840 --> 00:04:03.540
当然。咪涂得很好。
Of course. Mii spread it well.

00:04:02.500 --> 00:04:04.010
脆不脆？甜不甜？告诉咪。
Crunchy? Sweet? Tell Mii.

00:04:04.410 --> 00:04:07.910
咪想要摸摸头。小小的就行。
Mii wants a head pat. Small one.

00:04:11.540 --> 00:04:14.040
你：好吃！你鼻子上沾果酱啦，我给你擦擦
You: Yummy! You've got jam on your nose, let me wipe it off.

00:04:14.440 --> 00:04:17.490
当然。咪做得就是好吃。
Of course. Mii made it delicious.

00:04:20.100 --> 00:04:23.030
鼻子干净了吗？咪一直没动。
Nose clean? Mii stayed still.

00:04:23.430 --> 00:04:26.960
现在，摸摸头。咪值得。
Now. A head pat. Deserved.
